"Sussu is an original Questor, once of the Aleph grid, and knows that grid's backdoors."
"Her vault is a 300-foot adamant orb holding some thirty doomsday artifacts hoarded for ages."
"The vault holds the adamantium dagger that killed Syncarius, the first lich."
"Her nose-stud can cast a nuke able to devastate Esebus."
"Her shield layers strengthened force, dimensional enlargement and a reflecting skin."
"Her rule in Esebus is built for the greatest extraction from its people."
"Later, she keeps a trader-agent near Litcliff and sends assassins after Nathan Lark."
"Years later the Heirs rob her vault; she teleports there and Khachi kills her with a hammer blow."
"Sarah keeps her body in a dimensional bag, and Garna and Ushia take Esebus."
"She returns, hates the Heirs for the theft, and calls elders to the Aleph side with favors."
"At the Conclave she calls Nathan a thief, and Vesh kills her in a duel with an invisible strike."
